  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 10 Year Framework is an international effort agreed to by the United States and other UNEP member nations at Rio+20. The goal of the the Internatinal Partnership on Product Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) under the 10YFP is to enhance the accessibility of essential data for conducting product/commodity LCA, including through promoting interoperability of LCA databases globally, and collaboration on tools development to enhance applications, improve data access, and reduce costs of using LCA internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
